<title>POLAND: HUTA OLAWA OCT NET RISES TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>HUTA OLAWA OCT NET RISES TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.29 vs   0.26</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.49 vs   0.44</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.43 vs   0.37</p>
<p> Sales		    4.85 vs   4.07</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.70 vs   2.60</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.72 vs   4.28</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.15 vs   3.93</p>
<p> Sales		   40.87 vs  34.74</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish company is Huta Olawa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
